# Chaptarr (Readarr successor) — eBook + audiobook manager.
#
# No secrets required; values are inlined in compose.yaml.
#
# PUID/PGID must match the download-client user (host 1000:1000) so Chaptarr
# can hardlink/move completed downloads between /hive/downloads and /hive/library.
# UMASK=002 keeps new files group-writable for shared media consumers.